  "aboutBody": "Hub Market is your destination for authentic beauty and fragrance in the UAE. Since 2008 we've offered 100% genuine perfumes, skincare, makeup and haircare from the world's leading luxury brands — with competitive prices, fast delivery and trusted service.",
  "aboutCompany": "Hub Market Perfume & Cosmetics Trading LLC",
  "aboutAddress": "HHHR Tower, Sheikh Zayed Road, Trade Center First, Dubai, United Arab Emirates",
