  "helpIntro": "Answers to common questions. Still stuck? Reach our team below.",
  "helpSearchHint": "Search for help…",
  "helpFrequentlyAsked": "Frequently Asked",
  "helpLiveChat": "Live Chat",
  "helpCallUs": "Call Us",
  "helpEmailLabel": "Email",
  "helpQ1": "How does Hub Market guarantee 100% authentic products?",
  "helpA1": "At Hub Market, all perfumes, skincare, makeup, and haircare products are sourced from trusted suppliers and verified to ensure they are 100% authentic.",
  "helpQ2": "Are all perfumes, skincare, haircare and makeup sold by Hub Market original?",
  "helpA2": "Yes. We only offer genuine products from leading international luxury brands.",
  "helpQ3": "Does Hub Market have a marketplace?",
  "helpA3": "No. Hub Market doesn't operate a marketplace — we never list the same product at different prices or from different vendors. We only offer our own products, guaranteed 100% original.",
  "helpQ4": "What beauty products are available at Hub Market?",
  "helpA4": "We offer authentic perfumes, skincare products, makeup, and haircare products from top luxury brands worldwide.",
  "helpQ5": "How fast is Hub Market delivery?",
  "helpA5": "We deliver within 3 hours, and we're continuously working toward 2-hour delivery whenever possible.",
  "helpQ6": "Why are Hub Market prices competitive?",
  "helpA6": "Our goal is to make authentic luxury beauty more accessible through efficient sourcing and operations, allowing us to offer attractive prices.",
  "helpQ7": "Do you offer luxury beauty brands?",
  "helpA7": "Yes. Hub Market offers a curated collection of premium international brands across fragrances, skincare, makeup, and haircare.",
  "helpQ8": "Can I return or exchange products?",
  "helpA8": "Yes. We provide an easy return and exchange process in line with our policy.",
  "helpQ9": "Do you provide customer support after purchase?",
  "helpA9": "Absolutely. From 10 AM until 10 PM, our customer support team is available before and after your purchase to ensure a seamless shopping experience.",
  "helpQ10": "Why should I shop from Hub Market?",
  "helpA10": "Hub Market combines 100% authentic products, competitive pricing, fast delivery, trusted service, and years of beauty-industry experience since 2008.",
  "helpQOrders": "How can I track my order?",
  "helpAOrders": "Open Account → My Orders to see the status of each order.",
  "helpQPayments": "What payment methods do you accept?",
  "helpAPayments": "Cards via Network International, and Tabby (Pay in 4 / Pay Later) where available at checkout.",
  "helpQDelivery": "How fast is delivery?",
  "helpADelivery": "Free 3-hour delivery in Dubai, Sharjah & Ajman on orders over AED 150. The rest of the UAE is delivered within 24 hours.",
  "helpQReturns": "How do I return or exchange a product?",
  "helpAReturns": "Contact our support team within 14 days of delivery to arrange a return or exchange.",
  "helpQAuthentic": "Are all products 100% authentic?",
  "helpAAuthentic": "Yes. Every product is sourced from authorised distributors and is guaranteed 100% authentic.",
  "helpQLanguage": "How do I change the language?",
  "helpALanguage": "Use the EN / العربية toggle in the menu or in Settings.",
